{"ticker":{"symbol":"017550.KS","name":"수산세보틱스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1739.0,"change_pct":0.022941176470588243,"market_cap":108512083968.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.005750431282346176,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":4045.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Hwaseong-si","employees":null,"website":"https://soosancebotics.com","business_summary":"Soosan Cebotics Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacturing and sell of machinery for mining quarrying and construction in South Korea. The company offers attachments, which includes hydraulic breakers, crushers, multi-processors, pulverizers, and shears; hydraulic rock drills; civil engineering equipment, such as auger cranes, earth drills, and portable air compressors; telescopic and knuckle cranes; telescopic, knuckle and high load lift aerial work platforms; and insulated aerial work platform and airport equipment. The company was formerly known as Soosan Heavy Industries Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Soosan Cebotics Co., Ltd. in April 2025. The company was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Hwaseong-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"수산세보틱스(주)는 한국에서 광산 채석 및 건설용 기계를 제조 및 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 유압 차단기, 파쇄기, 다중 프로세서, 분쇄기 및 절단기를 포함하는 부착 장치를 제공합니다. 유압 착암기; 오거 크레인, 토공 드릴 및 휴대용 공기 압축기와 같은 토목 공학 장비; 텔레스코픽 및 너클 크레인; 텔레스코픽, 너클 및 고하중 리프트 고소 작업 플랫폼; 절연 공중 작업 플랫폼 및 공항 장비. 이 회사는 이전에 수산중공업주식회사로 알려졌으나 2025년 4월에 수산세보틱스주식회사로 상호를 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1984년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 화성에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"농기계·중장비","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":286296769350.0,"operating_income":22622873310.0,"net_income":15749353430.0,"eps":292.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":226540510510.0,"operating_income":16597088100.0,"net_income":16873038020.0,"eps":298.0